mobile/ios/Pods/

# Model weights: the 3 real, already-fetched weight files this project
# ships (vehicle_yolov8n.pt, smoke_yolov8s.pt, plate_best.pt) are
# committed on purpose so the app runs with real inference out of the
# box -- see ai/weights/README.md for provenance. Only a *newly trained*
# unified model (best.pt/last.pt from ai/training/train.py) is excluded,
# since that's reproducible from ai/training/train.py + your dataset and
# shouldn't bloat the repo on every retrain.
ai/weights/best.pt
ai/weights/last.pt

# Downloaded/merged dataset (large, reproducible from sources.yaml -- don't commit)
ai/dataset/_roboflow_downloads/
ai/dataset/processed/images/
ai/dataset/processed/labels/
!ai/dataset/processed/README.md
ai/dataset/raw/negatives/*
!ai/dataset/raw/negatives/README.md

# Env
.env
*.log
